10. Seed data pack (put verbatim in fixtures.json; expand consistently where needed)


Golden ticket AVQ-2314 "Extend payment order validation for SEPA instant", epic EPC-118 "Instant payments rollout". Story: extend validation so SEPA-instant payment orders above the configured limit are rejected with a dedicated error; limit initially 100,000 EUR; applies to AMI channel; reachability of beneficiary BIC must be checked. Acceptance criteria: (1) orders ≤ limit pass; (2) orders above limit rejected with AVQ_ERR_2231; (3) non-SEPA-instant unaffected; (4) relationship manager notified (UI-only → MANUAL).
Work packages: parametrization (SEPA_CHNL add row) 0.91 · script (pay_order_val#chk_sepa_inst) 0.87 · interface (AMI error catalog) 0.78 amber · test (ut_pay_order_val) 0.90.
Precedents: AVQ-1876 "SEPA instant amount limit validation" (intent 0.91, overlap 0.84, commits b3f19c2, a71e044, PR #482, author R. Keller, Done 2025-11-03) · AVQ-1544 "Channel-specific payment validation" (0.87/0.71) · AVQ-1102 "Cut-off validation for urgent payments" (0.74/0.42 — axis-disagreement example).
Precedent source (dark block + diff base):


  PROCEDURE chk_sepa_inst(i_ord IN t_pay_ord) IS
  BEGIN
    IF i_ord.chnl = k_chnl_sepa_inst
       AND i_ord.amt > cfg.max_amt(k_chnl_sepa_inst) THEN
      err.raise(k_err_amt_limit, i_ord.ord_id);   -- AVQ_ERR_2231
    END IF;
  END chk_sepa_inst;

Generated delta adds a BIC-reachability guard calling bic_dir.is_reachable(i_ord.ben_bic); iteration-1 compile error: PLS-00302: component 'IS_REACHABLE' must be declared (fixed in iteration 2 via correct package bic_dir_v2).


Knowledge cards: ami_message v3 (validated R. Keller) with the rule "new validation error ⇒ catalog entry + msg_def mapping; append-only field order" · parametrization v2 · avaloq_script v4. Missing card: dxd_feed — used by the AWAITING_DOCS demo; distilling the pasted doc creates dxd_feed v1.
Escalation ticket AVQ-2318 "Add BIC reachability feed reconciliation" — interface package 0.44, no precedent touches reconciliation, dxd_feed cardless → red path, 3 failed iterations, escalation with trace.
Incomplete ticket AVQ-2291 "Adjust payment validation" — vague; completeness 0.41; agent questions: "Which channels? Which limit? Which error code should be raised? Precedent AVQ-1876 specified all three."
Stats: 4,812 tickets indexed · 18,940 linked commits · zero-touch rate 27% (trend up).
Dependency edges: pay_order_val.max_amt → SEPA_CHNL.max_amt, pay_order_val errors → ami_msg_catalog. Co-change: "14 of 15 SEPA validation tickets touched pay_order_val + SEPA_CHNL + ut_pay_order_val."
